  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Ramp Up</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Choose three magic talents. You gain these magic talents, but may only use them (and any advanced talents which use them as prerequisites) starting on the 3rd, 5th, and 7th rounds of combat, respectively.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> If you possess the Card Casting drawback, you may create spell cards which incorporate these talents, but you may play such cards starting on the turns that their required talents become available.</p>\n<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> Card Casting 2: Counters and Control</sup></p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/drawback-feats#toc85\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
